{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05485","headline":"酬故人还山 · 宋鼎","name":"酬故人还山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举櫂乘春水，归山抚岁华。\n碧潭宵见月，红树晚开花。\n肃穆轻风度，依微隐径斜。\n危亭暗松石，幽涧落云霞。\n思鸟吟高树，游鱼戏浅沙。\n安知余兴尽，相望紫烟赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}